<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367938/eurocert/bb1.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="BRSR Reporting"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">ESG Disclosure, Verification &amp; Sustainability Reporting</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">BRSR <span class="text-eurogold-400">Verification Services</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Raise the bar for ESG disclosures in India with support for BRSR, BRSR Core, and selected ESG disclosure requirements.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is <span class="text-euro-600">BRSR?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Business Responsibility and Sustainability Reporting (BRSR) is India&#x27;s structured ESG disclosure framework for listed entities. It helps organizations report environmental, social, and governance performance in an investor-relevant format.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">BRSR is mandatory for the top 1,000 listed entities, with BRSR Core expanding through a phased glide path. It supports stronger transparency, governance accountability, and data-backed sustainability communication.</p></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784092641/BRSR_cegfux.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="Business Responsibility and Sustainability Reporting"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Business Responsibility and Sustainability Report</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Support Your <span class="text-euro-600">BRSR Journey</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">For listed entities, BRSR is now a critical reporting framework that helps communicate environmental, social, and governance performance in a structured and investor-relevant format.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">BRSR is mandatory for the top 1,000 listed entities from FY 2022â€“23. BRSR Core follows a glide path from top 150 entities in FY 2023â€“24 to top 1,000 by FY 2026â€“27.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-question-circle text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Why You Need BRSR</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">SEBI has put in place a phased BRSR Core framework for larger listed entities: top 150 (FY 2023â€“24), top 250 (FY 2024â€“25), top 500 (FY 2025â€“26), and top 1,000 (FY 2026â€“27).</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Value-chain ESG disclosures for top 250 listed entities are currently voluntary from FY 2025â€“26, and any related assessment or assurance is also voluntary unless SEBI updates the framework.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Practical takeaway: even where legal applicability is phased or voluntary, organizations increasingly need reliable ESG data, stronger controls, and better evidence trails.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-2 min-h-[320px] md:min-h-[400px] group flex items-center justify-center"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784092835/br_akojlv.png" class="w-full h-full object-contain transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="Circular infographic showing BRSR themes across environmental, social, governance, workforce, and CSR topics"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">What Most People Know</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">The Benefits of <span class="text-euro-600">BRSR Reporting</span></h2></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-100 shadow-sm bg-white p-2"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784093020/br1_zlb2ni.png" class="w-full h-auto object-contain" alt="Infographic showing benefits of BRSR reporting grouped into operational, reputational, and financial gains"/></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chart-line text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Enhanced Business Value</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">BRSR reporting strengthens your organizationâ€™s value proposition by demonstrating commitment to sustainable and responsible business practices.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-coins text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Access to Capital Investment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Clear ESG disclosures can improve confidence among ESG-conscious investors, lenders, and financial stakeholders.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Lowered Risk</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">BRSR helps identify and manage risk across operations, subsidiaries, supply chains, and investment portfolios.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-landmark text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Enhanced Corporate Governance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Structured reporting improves oversight, accountability, policy maturity, and decision-making at leadership level.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-users text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Talent &amp; Investor Confidence</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">A strong sustainability narrative supports employer branding, stakeholder confidence, and long-term market trust.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-10 p-7 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc]"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">BRSR Reporting: Why It Matters</h4><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">BRSR is no longer just a disclosure exercise. It is a business discipline linking sustainability performance with governance quality, risk visibility, investor communication, and operational accountability.</p><ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-500 text-sm"><li>â€¢ What are we measuring?</li><li>â€¢ What evidence supports the numbers?</li><li>â€¢ Are disclosures consistent across the reporting boundary?</li><li>â€¢ Can data withstand third-party review?</li></ul></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div><div class="mb-6"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Mandatory Verification</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Mandatory <span class="text-euro-600">Verification</span></h3><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-1 italic">*Indicative, not exhaustive</p></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-bolt text-sm"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-2">Electricity consumption, water usage, and air emissions</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-user-shield text-sm"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-2">Human rights commitments, minimum and fair wages</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-baby-carriage text-sm"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-2">Parental benefits and employee accessibility</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-balance-scale text-sm"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-2">Anti-corruption, anti-bribery, and conflict-of-interest policies</p></div></div></div><div><div class="mb-6"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Eurocert Advantage</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of BRSR Verification <span class="text-euro-600">from Eurocert SA</span></h3></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-leaf text-sm"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-2">Support for green-credit-related disclosures and underlying evidence, where relevant to engagement scope.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-globe-europe text-sm"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-2">BRSR verification can be aligned with recognized ESG frameworks such as TCFD, GRI, or CDP based on client need.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-gavel text-sm"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pt-2">Experienced review approach by qualified professionals with relevant ESG, audit, compliance, and governance experience.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Approach</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">How Eurocert SA <span class="text-eurogold-400">Assist &amp; Work</span></h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Essential &amp; Leadership Indicators</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Verification support for mandatory Essential Indicator (EI) disclosures and voluntary Leadership Indicator (LI) disclosures.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-star text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Scores and Structured Outputs</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Verification support for Transition/Parivartan Score, Combined Score, Core Transition/Parivartan Score, and Core Combined Score.</p></div></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-center text-white/60 text-sm mb-6">In addition, Eurocert SA is competent to assess and verify your:</p></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-8"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">A â€” General Disclosures</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive verification of general organizational disclosures and reporting.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"><i class="fas fa-sitemap text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">B â€” Management &amp; Process Disclosures</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Including Leadership &amp; Governance frameworks and management processes.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"><i class="fas fa-user-check text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-